        },
        {
          "text": "Isi keesa fulla hit'aana iti aarsani ta worqiini mid'aasaniifi Sanduqa Wold'aqisa, ka Waaqa, ka worqi dibaniti jira. Sanduqi kaani eele worqi ta sagale manna jed'ani qabduufi ule Haruni, ta baala baaftefi d'akha lama ka dubbi wold'aqisa irati t'aafisa qabdu qaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
